{"id":"580e312553b05c39","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-quantifier-axiom.md","title":"基础语言的组合量词公理","display":"df-quantifier-axiom — 基础语言的组合量词公理","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-quantifier-axiom","aliases":["91-df-quantifier-axiom","91-df-quant-axiom"],"display":"df-quantifier-axiom — 基础语言的组合量词公理","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-compositional-axioms]]","[[91-df-numeral]]","[[91-df-substitution-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-quantifier-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-quantifier-axiom</span><span>91-df-quant-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quantifier-axiom — 基础语言的组合量词公理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" href=\"?note=b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" title=\"91-df-compositional-axioms\">91-df-compositional-axioms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-quantifier-axiom-—-基础语言的组合量词公理-$\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\forall},\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\exists}$\">df-quantifier-axiom — 基础语言的组合量词公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\forall},\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\exists}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\forall},\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\exists}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (一元真理谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span> (自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的数字)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (至多以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 为自由变量的基础公式集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_x\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_x\\)</span> (捕获规避的数字代入编码函数,\nsee <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\forall}\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\varphi(x)\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\,\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n))\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\right\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\forall}\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\varphi(x)\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\,\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n))\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\right\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\exists}\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\exists x\\,\\varphi(x)\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\,\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n))\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\exists}\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\exists x\\,\\varphi(x)\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\,\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n))\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这些是对每个固定基础公式给出的对象语言模式；右侧通过数字代入的编码\n量化实例，不能写成把开放公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x)\\)</span> 直接放入真理谓词。</p>\n<p>在强 Kleene 语义中，量词的三值条件为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,\\varphi(x)\">\\(\\forall x\\,\\varphi(x)\\)</span>：所有实例真时为真；至少一个实例假时为假；\n没有假实例但至少一个未定义实例时为未定义；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\,\\varphi(x)\">\\(\\exists x\\,\\varphi(x)\\)</span>：至少一个实例真时为真；所有实例假时为假；\n没有真实例但至少一个未定义实例时为未定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>所以仅有一个间隙实例并不使全称句自动为假，也不使存在句自动为真。</p>\n<p>TB 的逐句双条件本身不等于上述统一量词组合模式；UTB 对每个固定\n基础公式的统一双条件、以及 CT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^-\">\\(^-\\)</span> 的组合公理，可以支持相应实例。\nKF 对整个真理语言使用强 Kleene 的正、负量词条款，不是“只允许正公式”；\nFS 则采用其组合原则并配合捕获/释放规则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-quantifier-axiom-—-基础语言的组合量词公理-$\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\forall},\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\exists}$","text":"df-quantifier-axiom — 基础语言的组合量词公理 $\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\forall},\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\exists}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":